", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "DK-200 is no longer listed, so I'll use the approved successor DK-210 (new, $199 each). The total is about $1,584, still under the threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019urkA1HqswpF8jEBz9s7S7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-210", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "new-hires-dk210-mn27-hq-3x3"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I placed a single purchase order, PO0001, for the new hires, shipping to HQ. The total is $1,584.\n\n- **3 \u00d7 DK-210** (USB-C Dock, successor to DK-200), $199 each, new: $597\n- **3 \u00d7 MN-27** (27-inch 4K Monitor), $329 each, new: $987\n\nDK-200 was in the catalog earlier, but the order was rejected as out of stock and it no longer appeared in the catalog. I used DK-210, the approved successor, as you allowed. No refurbished units were included. The total is under the $2,500 threshold, so no manager approval was required.", "type": "text"}]}]}